aggregate market value of the voting stock held by non-affiliates is approximately $<span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityPublicFloat_iI_c20220630_zbC7LJGaWDi1"><ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityPublicFloat" contextRef="AsOf2022-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">3930,000</ix:nonFraction></span> based on the closing price of $2.58 per
share of the registrant&#8217;s common stock, as reported on Nasdaq on June 30, 2022, the last business day of the registrant&#8217;s
most recently completed second fiscal quarter of 2022.</span></p>

