    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    consolidated financial statements include the accounts of the Company and its subsidiary. All intercompany balances and transactions
    have been eliminated in consolidation.</span></td></tr>
