    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
    of December 31, 2022, there was $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DeferredTaxAssetsTaxDeferredExpenseCompensationAndBenefitsShareBasedCompensationCost_iI_pn3n3_c20221231_zJ94ix85FyCc" title="Compensartion"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsTaxDeferredExpenseCompensationAndBenefitsShareBasedCompensationCost" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">186</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand of unrecognized compensation expense related to unvested share options. The Company
    recognizes compensation expense on a straight-line basis over the requisite service periods, which results in a weighted average
    period of approximately <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DeferredCompensationArrangementWithIndividualMaximumContractualTerm1_dtY_c20220101__20221231_z9lXzhcFJJCh" title="Contractual term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-01to2022-12-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:DeferredCompensationArrangementWithIndividualMaximumContractualTerm1">0.72</ix:nonNumeric></span> years over which the unrecognized compensation expense is expected to be recognized.</span></td></tr>
