    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b>&#160;</b></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b>C.</b></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><b>Loans From Stockholders &#8211; See Note 5</b></p>
</td></tr>
