                                            Science of the Company<b>, </b>under which, Tapsak Enterprises LLC dba Virginia Analytical,
                                            will provide laboratory space, equipment and materials to support the Company sensor development
                                            activities for total consideration which estimates to be approximately $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants_pn3n3_c20221024__20221025__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--MarkTapsakMember_z3cVSgskzMN3" title="Consideration"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" contextRef="From2022-10-242022-10-25_custom_MarkTapsakMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">60</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand.</span></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
    the year ended on December 31, 2022, the Company recognized in total expenses of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionExpensesFromTransactionsWithRelatedParty_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--MarkTapsakMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--TapsakEnterprisesLLCMember_zsSgr0sF5rvb" title="Total related parties expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionExpensesFromTransactionsWithRelatedParty" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_MarkTapsakMember_custom_TapsakEnterprisesLLCMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">38</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand due to this agreement.</span></p></td></tr>
